    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "TRAIN",
      "narration_text": "Only then does the real training start. The machine has 116,480 little numbers inside it, all set randomly at first. It plays the guessing game for about 4 minutes, nudging every one of them a tiny bit each time it is wrong.",
