    {
      "beat_id": "B18",
      "act": "VERDICT",
      "narration_text": "So here is the whole thing, from nothing to writing code. A guessing game, played over two million characters. Shortcuts it invented by itself, just by counting. Looking backwards, never forwards. The maths checked twice before trusting it. An easy exam before the hard one. And ninety-six choices, narrowed down to about five.",
